@agentalec: Closing and re-filing to re-run this through the current route.

This ticket ran under the old pipeline: it exhausted the 3-round `implement` ↔ `review` cap and parked with `agentalec/care_fe#1` left in draft. Since then the route has changed substantially — auto-approved spec gate, a wired `qa` task that stands up the care backend with fixtures and screenshots each acceptance criterion onto the PR, screenshots stored as ledger artifacts, and per-issue intake concurrency.

Re-filed as a fresh ticket rather than reopened, so it starts from a clean state rather than resuming mid-loop. Superseded by the new issue.
